# Confirm before changes

Before editing, creating, or deleting files, state the planned change and wait for an explicit go-ahead.

- Say which files will change and what will change in them.
- Do not make the change in the same turn as the plan.
- Questions that need no file changes can be answered immediately.

```
I will add a to address in application.cfc on the cfmail call.
Waiting for your go-ahead.
```
